<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mrs. Tubman returns three months after starting modafinil and increasing candesartan to 16 mg. She takes modafinil each morning and two scheduled 15-minute naps, and unplanned sleep episodes are now rare, only while seated. Her headache diary shows 21 headache days in the past three months, against 54 before treatment. She uses acetaminophen about once a week and has taken no ibuprofen. She has had no palpitations, insomnia, or loss of appetite on modafinil and no dizziness on candesartan. She is back to running her household and her church work. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sleep episodes</td><td>Rare and only while seated, with two planned naps a day</td></tr><tr><td>Headache diary</td><td>21 headache days in three months, down from 54</td></tr><tr><td>Acute medicine</td><td>Acetaminophen about once a week; no ibuprofen</td></tr><tr><td>Medication tolerance</td><td>No palpitations, insomnia, or appetite loss on modafinil; no dizziness on candesartan</td></tr><tr><td>Function</td><td>Running her household and church work again</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

